{"id":"d7c14afe5ff8ba89","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-herbrand-unsatisfiability.md","title":"Herbrand Unsatisfiability Theorem","display":"thm-herbrand-unsatisfiability — Herbrand Unsatisfiability Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-herbrand-unsatisfiability","aliases":["57-thm-herbrand-unsatisfiability"],"display":"thm-herbrand-unsatisfiability — Herbrand Unsatisfiability Theorem","depends_on":["[[57-df-consistent]]","[[57-df-satisfiable]]","[[57-df-prop-sat]]","[[57-df-herbrand-expansion]]","[[57-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-herbrand-unsatisfiability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-herbrand-unsatisfiability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-herbrand-unsatisfiability — Herbrand Unsatisfiability Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dd50e51ec6d9cf91\" href=\"?note=dd50e51ec6d9cf91\" title=\"57-df-consistent\">57-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"befcfc958ddf5dbd\" href=\"?note=befcfc958ddf5dbd\" title=\"57-df-satisfiable\">57-df-satisfiable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"083ea30cb34a396c\" href=\"?note=083ea30cb34a396c\" title=\"57-df-prop-sat\">57-df-prop-sat</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"341dd891eed2b080\" href=\"?note=341dd891eed2b080\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-expansion\">57-df-herbrand-expansion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为一阶字母表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{UnivSent}_S\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{UnivSent}_S\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqFree}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{EqFree}(\\varphi)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UnivSent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{UnivSent}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqFree}\">\\(\\mathrm{EqFree}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"341dd891eed2b080\" href=\"?note=341dd891eed2b080\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-expansion\">57-df-herbrand-expansion</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PropSat}\">\\(\\mathrm{PropSat}\\)</span> 分别取一阶非空结构满足性和原子任意布尔赋值满足性；基实例无量词且闭合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{Sat}(\\{\\varphi\\})\\leftrightarrow\\exists E_0\\subseteq E(\\varphi)\\;\\bigl(|E_0|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\neg\\mathrm{PropSat}(E_0)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\mathrm{Sat}(\\{\\varphi\\})\\leftrightarrow\\exists E_0\\subseteq E(\\varphi)\\;\\bigl(|E_0|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\neg\\mathrm{PropSat}(E_0)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>排除把内建等号当作任意命题字母的错误；一般句子须先作适当的全称化/Skolem 化，不能在 E 未定义的输入上调用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"dd50e51ec6d9cf91","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-